{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1519072-need-help-coming-up-with-side-quest-ideas","id":1519072,"title":"Need help coming up with side quest ideas","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-07-28T22:29:18-07:00","id":1519072,"title":"Need help coming up with side quest ideas","content":"My friends &amp; I are very new to MTA and one of the said that the game is missing side quests that are taylored to their individual Conventions (we are playing a Technocrat game). We have been playing Dark Ages Vampire for a very long time and I can come up with this sort of thing with minimal effort. MTA on the other hand is killing me. The main storyline that we have going is that the Red Star (Werewolf) has been detected by the Union whose job was it to alter NASA's computer records &amp; upload a code or virus (I have 0 computer skill, so I have no idea what it would be in RL) that would erase the information from their system &amp; remove all knowledge of the anomoly from the computer user's memory when they would look at the data concerning it. Long story short, this has lead them to a Marauder who has something to do with the star &amp; they have to kill him. What sort of side missions can I send them on? Two of them are N.W.O., one is a Syndicate member, and the other is a Progenitor. Thanks in advance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24119-alucardtes","name":"Alucardtes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24119_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-29T05:09:13-07:00","id":1519103,"title":"","content":"Their conventions aren't the key here. Who are they, what fo they care for, who do they care for? That's the kind of context you build plots from.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-29T06:49:56-07:00","id":1519107,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1519072-need-help-coming-up-with-side-quest-ideas?p=1519103#post1519103\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Their conventions aren't the key here. Who are they, what fo they care for, who do they care for? That's the kind of context you build plots from.</div> </div> </div> </div>This.<br /> <br /> Also character concept. Someone playing a MiB or chemically enhanced super soldier will likely expect something different than one playing a psychologist or media influencer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-29T10:40:48-07:00","id":1519119,"title":"","content":"As others have said we need a bit more info.<br /> <br /> Also what type of side adventure do they want - something based on their roles within their Convention (office politics, police procedural, research, training exercise etc)? <br /> <br /> Or something based on their character back stories (so life outside the convention if there is such a thing in the Technocracy - think the Apple series - Severance), friend in need, soap opera kind of fluff (so back story, plus relevant merits &amp; flaws etc)<br /> <br /> So different types of side adventure but depends on what they want and what their concept is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27824-arcanus","name":"Arcanus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27824_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"148"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-31T18:50:27-07:00","id":1519305,"title":"","content":"Side quests are exactly that, unrelated to the story; so, get the mages mixed up in a Vampire power-struggle in the city or have a Marauder in town, causing trouble.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-01T03:43:49-07:00","id":1519328,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Iguazu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1519072-need-help-coming-up-with-side-quest-ideas?p=1519305#post1519305\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Side quests are exactly that, unrelated to the story; so, get the mages mixed up in a Vampire power-struggle in the city or have a Marauder in town, causing trouble.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes and no, because dependant on the character you can easily add story elements to each of your mains stories that resonate with the characters needs and issues and then create juicy conflict and drama for the table. So facets and complications of the main story can easily be plot B to the plot A of the Technocratic Mission they are on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}